		{"id":"5eba0bf5bc95ed11","type":"text","text":"Unless otherwise specified, casters can utilize spellcraft an amount of times equal to half  their **Spellcraft** die (3 for a d6, etc.). This increases to their **Spellcraft [[Die Max]]** in the third middle, then twice their **Spellcraft [[Die Max]]** on the fourth. Attempting to cast more results in the \"Drained\" **[Minor Metaphysical Harm](Harm)**. The same thing happens if they attempt to utilize a spell they have 0 dice in (increasing in **[[Harm]]** level ~every 2 levels of success.","x":-382,"y":191,"width":610,"height":209},
